      "id": "44c46351190f49c0a76d0"
    },
    {
      "text": "```\nOracle AND to combine more than two Boolean expressions example\n\nYou can use multiple AND operators to combine Boolean expressions.\n\nFor example, the following statement retrieves the orders that meet all the following conditions:\n\n    placed in 2017\n    is in charge of the salesman id 60\n    has the shipped status.\n\n    ```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
