      "text": "%sql\n---The following statement finds all orders which are in charge of the salesman id 54, 55, and 56:\n\nSELECT\n    order_id,\n    customer_id,\n    status,\n    salesman_id\nFROM\n    orders\nWHERE\n    salesman_id IN (\n        54,\n        55,\n        56\n    )\nORDER BY\n    order_id;",
